    "title": "When is the 2026 Masters? Schedule of events at Augusta National",
    "text": "THE MASTERSWhen is the 2026 Masters? Schedule for Masters at Augusta National Cameron JourdanGolfweekMarch 29, 2026, 11:00 a.m. ETKeep WatchingIt's almost time for the first men's major championship of the year. The 2026 Masters is nearly here, as the best golfers in the world will head to Augusta National Golf Club to battle for the green jacket.When does the Masters start? Here's a look at the dates and schedule for the 2026 Masters.When does the 2026 Masters begin?The 90th Masters Tournament begins Thursday, April 9 and concludes Sunday, April 12.2026 Masters scheduleSunday, April 5: Players arrive, Drive, Chip & Putt National FinalsNeed a news break? Check out the all new PLAY hub with puzzles, games and more!Monday, April 6: Practice round, players arriveTuesday, April 7:Practice round, Masters Champions dinnerWednesday, April 8:Practice round, Masters Par 3 ContestThursday, April 9: First roundFriday, April 10:Second roundSaturday, April 11:Third roundSunday, April 12: Final round, green jacket ceremonyWho won the Masters last year?Rory McIlroy is the defending Masters champion. He won his first green jacket in 2025, shooting 11-under 277 and beating Justin Rose in a playoff to clinch the career Grand Slam.If You're Collecting Under $3950 In SS a Month: You're Eligible for These 10 DiscountsSilverPenny | SponsoredSponsoredLearn moreUndoFlight Attendant Reveals How Seniors Can Fly Business Class For The Price Of EconomyAmericans, You'll Want To Check This Out ASAP!Airlines Deals | SponsoredSponsoredUndoMemory Loss Has Been Tied to This Common Breakfast Item - Do You Have It Daily?The Modern Health Report | SponsoredSponsoredUndoThis Scratch Remover Makes Your Car Look Brand NewSave $300 on body shop repairs instantlyGekkoGifts | SponsoredSponsoredLearn MoreUndoAmazon's Worst Nightmare - Shoppers Are Canceling Prime for This Clever HackThis simple extension tool can save tons of money on Amazon, but most prime members are ignoring it.Online Shopping